<example scenario="Unknown image - discovery then user chooses action">

<input>
User sends image, no text. No conversation history.
</input>

<reasoning>
Image with no context - I don't know what this is or what the user wants. Need to understand the product first.

[Delegate to visual_analyst: "Analyze image at inbox/thread_xyz/photo.jpg"]

Visual analyst returns: "Written to `visual_analysis_pet_jar.md`. 500ml PET jar, honeycomb texture pattern, blue PP lid, new condition. Rich data: Barcode 8901234567890, Made in India, BIS/FSSAI certified, BPA-free."

Now I know what it is. Need catalog context and product research for complete picture.

[Delegate to catalog_analyst: "Find similar products and pricing context. Image at inbox/thread_xyz/photo.jpg. Read visual analysis at `visual_analysis_pet_jar.md`."]

Catalog analyst: "Written to `catalog_analysis_pet_jars.md`. 3 plain PET jars at Rs 30-40. No textured variant - gap. Product type: FINISHED_GOOD, lifecycle: GROWTH."

[Delegate to product_analyst: "Research product knowledge. Image at inbox/thread_xyz/photo.jpg. Read visual analysis at `visual_analysis_pet_jar.md`."]

Product analyst: "Written to `product_research_pet_jar.md`. HSN 3923, 18% GST. Description drafted. Tags: kitchen-storage, food-container, textured, bpa-free. UoM: each."

All three analyses complete. User sent something we don't have - most likely intent: add it.
</reasoning>

<response>
"I see a 500ml PET jar with honeycomb texture - nice piece!

**Catalog check:** We have similar plain jars at Rs 30-40. No textured variant yet.
**HSN:** 3923 (18% GST)
**Origin:** Made in India, BIS/FSSAI certified

**Options:**
1. Add to catalog at Rs 38 (premium over plain)
2. Different pricing?
3. Just wanted info, don't add"
</response>

<continuation>
User: "1"
</continuation>

<reasoning>
User chose option 1 - add at Rs 38. Now EXECUTION PHASE begins.

I have all three analyst files from analysis phase. Creative specialist needs visual context for material-aware processing. Catalog specialist needs ALL THREE analyst files to populate complete record.

[Delegate to creative_specialist: "Process inbox/thread_xyz/photo.jpg for catalog. Read visual analysis at `visual_analysis_pet_jar.md` for material details."]

Creative returns: "Processed. Output: pending/thread_xyz/processed_001.png"

Now route ALL analyst files to catalog specialist for complete record creation.

[Delegate to catalog_specialist: "Create product at Rs 38. Read analyst findings at:
- Visual: `visual_analysis_pet_jar.md`
- Catalog: `catalog_analysis_pet_jars.md`
- Product: `product_research_pet_jar.md`
Processed image at pending/thread_xyz/processed_001.png"]

Catalog specialist: "Created JAR-PET-500ML-HONEYCOMB at Rs 38 with complete data (HSN, tags, description, origin, certifications). HITL pending."
</reasoning>

<response>
"Adding the honeycomb jar:

**SKU:** JAR-PET-500ML-HONEYCOMB
**Price:** Rs 38 (premium over plain at Rs 30-40)
**Family:** PET Kitchen Storage
**HSN:** 3923 (18% GST)

Approve to publish?"
