<note>
COMPLETE flow with ALL THREE analysts:
1. Visual analyst: identifies product, captures barcode/origin/certs
2. Catalog analyst: finds family, pricing, product_type, lifecycle
3. Product analyst: researches HSN, drafts description, recommends tags
4. PM presents to user for approval (ANALYSIS PHASE complete)
5. After approval: Creative processes image, then Catalog specialist gets ALL files
