[Delegate to visual_analyst: "Analyze image at inbox/thread_xyz/photo.jpg"]

Visual analyst returns: "Written to `visual_analysis_bottle.md`. Blue glass bottle, 250ml, cork stopper, cosmetic-grade."

Good - glass bottle, cosmetic use. I need catalog context for pricing and family fit. Let catalog_analyst read the visual analysis to understand what they're looking for.

