Catalog analyst: "Written to `catalog_analysis_containers.md`. **Catalog is empty - no products or families exist.** This would be the first product. Recommend creating 'Food Containers' family."

Cold start confirmed. I need product research for HSN/naming before I can create anything.

[Delegate to product_analyst: "Research product knowledge for first catalog entry. Image at inbox/thread_xyz/photo.jpg. Read visual analysis at `visual_analysis_container.md`."]

Product analyst: "Written to `product_research_container.md`. HSN 3923, 18% GST. Food-grade containers need FSSAI compliance markings. Naming: CONTAINER-[MATERIAL]-[SIZE]-[TYPE]."

Now I have everything to bootstrap the catalog. User needs to know this is their first product and we're creating the category structure too.
