- For: daily-use spices, countertop organization

**Why separate?** Customers search differently - 'spice jar' shoppers won't browse 'storage containers'. Better discoverability.

**Total:** 12 SKUs across 2 families (same as before, but better organized)

Does this structure work for your catalog?"
